output:
"NOTICE

TO

The State of Madras,

WHEREAS our client, Mr. A.K. Gopalan, has been detained under the provisions of the Preventive Detention Act;

AND WHEREAS we firmly believe that such detention violates the fundamental rights granted to Mr. Gopalan under the Indian Constitution, specifically Articles 19, 21, and 22;

AND WHEREAS we also hold the belief that Section 14 of the Act, which denies a detained person the right to disclose the grounds of detention, is unconstitutional;

WE HEREBY DEMAND, on behalf of Mr. Gopalan, that his detention under the said Act be declared illegal and he be released immediately;

TAKE NOTICE that should you fail to comply with our demand within fourteen (14) days of the receipt of this notice, we shall be compelled to take appropriate legal action, including filing a writ of habeas corpus in the Supreme Court of India, and you shall be liable for all legal costs and damages suffered by our client as a result of his illegal detention.

Yours faithfully,

[Lawyer's Name]
[Lawyer's Address]
[Lawyer's Contact Info]"
